"promotionalText" = "PetTomo 2.2.4 fixes a feed-related crash and improves stability for smoother shared virtual pet care.";
"description" = "[ PetTomo: The Shared Virtual Pet Game for Couples and Friends ]\n\nLooking for a cute way to stay connected with your favorite person? PetTomo is the shared virtual pet app designed for couples, best friends, and family. Co-parent an adorable digital companion and turn your daily moments into a rewarding journey of growth and bonding.\n\nWhether you are in a long-distance relationship (LDR) or just want a new way to share your day, PetTomo brings you closer through the simple act of raising a pet together.\n\n---\n\n[[ CO-RAISE WITH LOVE ]]\nInvite your partner or best friend to your shared room. Together, you will care for a unique virtual pet that grows based on your interactions. It is the perfect, low-stress way to build a daily ritual together.\n\n[[ PHOTO-TO-FEED SYSTEM ]]\nYour daily photos are the fuel! Take a picture of your lunch, your commute, or a sunset and send it to your pet. Watch as your pet \"eats\" your memories and grows happier with every share. It creates a beautiful, living photo diary of your relationship.\n\n[[ DECORATE YOUR SHARED HOME ]]\nEarn rewards to buy furniture, cute accessories, and beautiful backgrounds. Now with -- Adjustable Furniture Sizes -- you can customize your pet's room to perfectly reflect your shared style and creativity.\n\n[[ STAY CONNECTED VIA CHAT ]]\nOur built-in room chat lets you react to each other's photos and stay in touch while looking after your pet. Every notification is a gentle reminder that someone special is thinking of you.\n\n[[ COLLECT PRECIOUS MEMORIES ]]\nLook back through your pet's photo diary to relive all the small moments that make your bond special. See how much your pet—and your relationship—has grown over time.\n\n---\n\n[ PERFECT FOR: ]\n- COUPLES: A fun, interactive \"couple app\" to stay connected throughout the day.\n- LONG-DISTANCE (LDR): Bridge the gap with a shared daily ritual.\n- BEST FRIENDS: Create a digital mascot for your friendship and decorate together.\n- VIRTUAL PET LOVERS: A modern, social twist on a classic pet-raising experience.\n\nStart your shared journey today. Download PetTomo and nurture your bond, one photo at a time.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/";
"whatsNew" = "Ver 2.2.4 Update Details\n- Fixed an issue where a transient feed refresh timeout could be reported as a crash after uploading a pet photo.\n- Improved stability when moving between feed, chat, and home screens.";
